<title>USA: FirstMerit to take $0.19/shr charge in Q3.</title>
<headline>FirstMerit to take $0.19/shr charge in Q3.</headline>
<dateline>AKRON, Ohio 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>FirstMerit Corp said on Tuesday that it will take a one-time after-tax charge of $6.1 million, or $0.19 per share, in the third quarter as a result an assessment for the Savings Association Insurance Fund (SAIF).</p>
<p>The company said the SAIF assessment had been anticipated.</p>
</text>
